{"case_id": "m05", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.6-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Formula:**\n$$I = P \\times i \\times t$$\n\n**Where:**\n*   $I$ = Interest\n*   $P$ = Principal amount (Capital)\n*   $i$ = Interest rate (converted to decimal)\n*   $t$ = Time in years\n\n**Substitution:**\n$$I = 5\\,000 \\times 0.08 \\times 3$$\n*(Note: $8\\% = \\frac{8}{100} = 0.08$)*\n\n**Working:**\n$$I = 400 \\times 3$$\n$$I = 1\\,200$$\n\n**Final Answer:**\n**R1 200**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 10.716, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 466, "output_tokens": 1178, "reasoning_tokens": 1015, "cost_usd": 0.001107, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["AkashML"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:31"}
{"case_id": "m41", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.6-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "$\\text{Formula: } T_n = a + (n-1)d$\n\n$\\text{Given: } a = 7, \\ d = 4, \\ n = 25$\n\n$T_{25} = 7 + (25 - 1) \\times 4$\n\n$= 7 + 24 \\times 4$\n\n$= 7 + 96$\n\n$= 103$\n\n$\\therefore \\text{The 25th term is } 103.$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 9.14, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 419, "output_tokens": 1303, "reasoning_tokens": 1183, "cost_usd": 0.001215, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Parasail"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:35"}
{"case_id": "m43", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.6-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "Geometric sequence: $T_n = a r^{n-1}$  \n$a = 2$  \n$r = \\frac{T_2}{T_1} = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$  \n$T_8 = 2 \\times 3^{8-1}$  \n$T_8 = 2 \\times 3^7$  \n$T_8 = 2 \\times 2187$  \n$T_8 = 4374$  \n\n$\\therefore$ The 8th term is $4374$.", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 10.453, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 481, "output_tokens": 1315, "reasoning_tokens": 1189, "cost_usd": 0.001232, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["AkashML"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:37"}
{"case_id": "m42", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.6-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "Given: $a = 3$, $d = 7 - 3 = 4$, $n = 20$\n\nThis is an arithmetic sequence.\n\nFormula:  \n$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n - 1)d]$\n\nSubstitute:  \n$S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}[2(3) + (20 - 1)(4)]$\n\n$= 10[6 + 19(4)]$\n\n$= 10[6 + 76]$\n\n$= 10[82]$\n\n$\\therefore S_{20} = 820$\n\n**Final answer:** 820", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 11.482, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 427, "output_tokens": 1458, "reasoning_tokens": 1297, "cost_usd": 0.001355, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["AkashML"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:38"}
{"case_id": "m44", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.6-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "Geometric series with:\n$a = 16$\n$r = \\frac{8}{16} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n\nSince $|r| < 1$, the series converges and $S_{\\infty}$ exists.\n\n$S_{\\infty} = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$\n\n$S_{\\infty} = \\frac{16}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n\n$\\therefore S_{\\infty} = 32$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 10.719, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 414, "output_tokens": 1309, "reasoning_tokens": 1179, "cost_usd": 0.00122, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["AkashML"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:41"}
